## Common Derived Data Patterns

### Count Columns
```php
$table->unsignedInteger('__orders_count')->default(0);
$table->unsignedInteger('__active_users_count')->default(0);
$table->unsignedInteger('__pending_tasks_count')->default(0);
```

### Date/Time Columns
```php
$table->timestamp('__last_login_at')->nullable();
$table->timestamp('__last_payment_at')->nullable();
$table->timestamp('__first_created_at')->nullable();
```

### Amount/Value Columns
```php
$table->decimal('__total_revenue', 10, 2)->default(0.00);
$table->decimal('__average_rating', 3, 2)->default(0.00);
$table->unsignedInteger('__total_points')->default(0);
```

### Status/Aggregate Columns
```php
$table->string('__status_summary')->nullable();
$table->json('__recent_activities')->nullable();
$table->boolean('__has_active_subscription')->default(false);
```

