## Examples

### User Table with Derived Data
```php
/* Derived data columns */
Schema::table('users', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->unsignedInteger('__orders_count')->default(0);
    $table->timestamp('__last_order_at')->nullable();
    $table->decimal('__total_spent', 10, 2)->default(0.00);
    $table->boolean('__is_vip_customer')->default(false);
    
    $table->index('__orders_count');
    $table->index('__total_spent');
    $table->index('__is_vip_customer');
});
```

### Product Table with Derived Data
```php
/* Derived data columns */
Schema::table('products', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->unsignedInteger('__sales_count')->default(0);
    $table->decimal('__average_rating', 3, 2)->default(0.00);
    $table->timestamp('__last_sold_at')->nullable();
    $table->boolean('__is_bestseller')->default(false);
    
    $table->index('__sales_count');
    $table->index('__average_rating');
    $table->index('__is_bestseller');
});
```

