## Cursor Instructions

- Always include derived data columns when creating new tables
- Use the `__` prefix for all derived columns
- Separate derived columns in their own `Schema::table()` call
- Add appropriate indexes for performance
- Consider what aggregated data would be useful for fast queries
- Document the purpose of each derived column in comments